{
 "thread": "0-G5QvXGQc4",
 "subject": "Urgent: min.per.group for multiple groups",
 "messages_listed": 3,
 "last_activity": "2016-07-22T16:05:56Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "mHccG3GjAQAJ",
   "from": "Rajat Singhania",
   "author": "a9fc767a51d12e9a",
   "date": "2016-07-22T01:29:56Z",
   "subject": "Urgent: min.per.group for multiple groups",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>I am wondering how the min.per.group works when I have 2 groups, one with treatment=0, and the other with treatment=1.</div><div><br></div><div>Say I have 12 samples with treatment=0, and 3 samples with treatment=1.  If I want to get minimum 11 out of the 12 samples with treatment=0 &amp; all the 3 treatment=1 samples, should I use min.per.group=c(3L, 11L) or c(11L, 3L)?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much,</div><div>Rajat</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "r1504C2mAQAJ",
   "from": "Dhruva Chandramohan",
   "author": "38c56d0e82a34280",
   "date": "2016-07-22T02:20:05Z",
   "subject": "Re: [methylkit_discussion] Urgent: min.per.group for multiple groups",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The current functionality (based on the source code <a href=\"https://github.com/al2na/methylKit/blob/master/R/backbone.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/al2na/methylKit/blob/master/R/backbone.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793233164548000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Lv7kdYbyJmtx5jiLIeEq_\">here</a> , about halfway down) expects a single integer to be used for both groups, so it won&#39;t quite do what you want. One quasi-solution would be to use the reorganize function to temporarily assign the samples to a single group, to at least ensure coverage over most of the data.<div><br></div><div>If you really want to try with unequal groups and need it quickly, you can try copying the code and making your own custom version of the unite function by tweaking this section to make min.per.group a vector and indexing into it:<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><table style=\"border-spacing:0px;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">  <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">for</span>(<span>i</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">in</span> unique(<span>object</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">@</span><span>treatment</span>) ){</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">      <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">my.ind</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span>coverage.ind</span>[<span>object</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">@</span><span>treatment</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">==</span><span>i</span>]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">      <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">ldat</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">!</span><a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793233164548000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0sA3xjg7-bXnT0PnUEERP1\">is.na</a>(<span>df</span>[,<span>my.ind</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">with</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">FALSE</span>])</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">      <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">if</span>(  is.null(dim(<span>ldat</span>))  ){  <span style=\"color:rgb(150,152,150)\"># if there is only one dimension</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">        <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">df</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span>df</span>[<span>ldat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span>min.per.group</span>,]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">      }<span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">else</span>{</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">        <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">df</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span>df</span>[rowSums(<span>ldat</span>)<span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span>min.per.group</span>,]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">      }</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.298039);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-width:0px 1px 0px 0px\"></td><td style=\"padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\">    }</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
